Contains multiple standalone modules with tests.
Files: coupon.py, order.py, restaurant.py, tip.py, loyalty.py + test files.
Real-life examples covered:
Coupon discounts.
Order billing with tax.
Restaurant open/close.
Tip calculator.
Loyalty points redemption.
Each module has a dedicated test file.
Requires pytest installed.
Run tests with: pytest -v "UNIT TESTING WITH PYTEST/".
Run specific test file: pytest -v UNIT TESTING WITH PYTEST/test_tip.py.
Example output shows all PASSED test cases.